arts  with the ideation phase  uh where the pre-competitive project  idea is being raised the idea can come  from anybody  uh then the idea is being validated with  the community in terms of the benefits  and the interest  and once there is a buy in for that  particular idea it then starts to take a  shape into a project that has a clear  problem statement and the industry  benefit  the outcome can be a member-funded  project or a program it can be a new  formed community of  experts and um this is the exact same  path  that  we went on for creating the woman in  stem pilot program that i'm about to  present you so women account for only  three percent of the ceos in this field  and this is why the pistol alliance has  chosen to focus this pilot scheme on the  leadership roles because we believe that  um we believe in the top-down  changes and in creating more role models  for the future generations  um  and just to tell you that these women in  stem pilot program it's a first step in  a wider diversity and inclusion in stem  leadership initiative and we are aiming  to run a series of future programs as of  september this year  uh using the feedback and the learnings  from this pilot program um  we would like to form a community of  leaders who share the same values and  that want to contribute to the change in  the overall industry either by directly  changing or by promoting uh equality in  their organizations  [Music]
 

